#Requires -Version 7.0

<#
.SYNOPSIS
  Scaffolds Vouch /types and /schemas files.

.DESCRIPTION
  Creates:
  - types/common.ts
  - types/{domain}.ts
  - schemas/common.ts
  - schemas/{domain}.ts
  - index barrel files

  Scope intentionally excludes:
  - DTOs
  - read models
  - Prisma mirrors
  - transaction types
  - repository/query result shapes
  - payment provider payload shapes

.NOTES
